  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Project templates consolidated for the Cookie-authentication host (the only public host from Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Starter / the \"Codeer.LowCode.Blazor\" Visual Studio template): every template now includes the AppUser module and an `app_users` table with the initial user admin/admin. \"Empty (with authentication)\" replaces \"Empty\"; \"Pattern Showcase (with authentication)\" is merged into \"Pattern Showcase\" (data source PatternsSQLite, sqlite_patterns_v5.db); GettingStarted / InventoryManagement / SFA / ProjectManagement gained AppUser (sqlite_sample_v2.db / inventory_v2.db / sfa_v2.db / project_management_v2.db). Template folder names EmptyAuth and PatternShowcaseAuth no longer exist.\n- Pattern Showcase approval samples (expense / leave requests) rebuilt on Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras ApprovalFlowField: approval modules, the \"my approvals\" / \"approval status\" lists and the route master are what the designer's approval setup (Tools > approval flow setup / `approval-setup`) generates; the hand-written template-driven approval modules are gone. Claude Code workspace docs (auth_patterns / auth_workflow / rules) updated accordingly.\n- Sample databases: new files only (existing local files are never overwritten); the previous database files were removed from the package.",
